If you don’t want to deal with lacing up your boots every time you go outside in the dead of winter, these are your boots. The BOGS Neo-Classic Tall Work Boots are warm, waterproof, durable, and precisely what you want on your feet in harsh conditions. (Trust us—the author tested her pair on a night where the high reached -10℉ and the windchill felt like -30℉, standing by a fire truck in the dark. Her toes stayed warm.)

